  [ 54] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 56] extcall 6 ............................... updateStage()
  [ 58] endrepeat [  5]
  [ 61] getlocal 0 .............................. <Knapp>
  [ 63] pusharglist 1 ........................... <Knapp>
  [ 65] extcall 2 ............................... <rollOver(Knapp)>
